{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":939071,\"title\":\"Robocon: The Movie\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Robocon and his friends in a theatrical release of the ninth episode of the TV series.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gYHccbgVu2GqJSBTTPX8KFkrl3n.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":1975,\"runtime\":25,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Atsuo Okunaka\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1734079,\"name\":\"Atsuo Okunaka\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rYJPfDhBotrDYyT7Xezczc2Cmkg.jpg\"},{\"id\":3293197,\"name\":\"Shigehisa Ono\",\"character\":\"Shintaro Oyama\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1253845,\"name\":\"Midori Katō\",\"character\":\"Hatsue Oyama\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z9EosEyw5lnYbO5cIz7IKNdaLQC.jpg\"},{\"id\":3106011,\"name\":\"Yoshikazu Yamada\",\"character\":\"Hajime Oyama\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3293198,\"name\":\"Mayumi Sakuma\",\"character\":\"Midori Oyama\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1241620,\"name\":\"Keiko Yamamoto\",\"character\":\"Robocon (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4w3OVUdjzN0EpIij0gDYvnbOXx.jpg\"},{\"id\":111965,\"name\":\"Keiichi Noda\",\"character\":\"Gantz (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cWeP5BjPWSzQPLhCCAXrxHqb7KF.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":10681,\"title\":\"WALL·E\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hbhFnRzzg6ZDmm8YAmxBnQpQIPh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nYs4ZwnJBK4AgljhvzwNz7fpr3E.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After hundreds of years doing what he was built for, WALL•E—a robot designed to clean up the earth—discovers a new purpose in life when he meets a sleek search robot named EVE. EVE comes to realize that WALL•E has inadvertently stumbled upon the key to the planet's future, and races back to space to report to the humans. Meanwhile, WALL•E chases EVE across the galaxy and sets into motion one of the most imaginative adventures ever brought to the big screen.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1184918,\"title\":\"The Wild Robot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTnV3PCVW5O92JMrFvvrRcV39RU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pmXyN3sKeYoUhu5VBZiDU4BX21.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a shipwreck, an intelligent robot called Roz is stranded on an uninhabited island. To survive the harsh environment, Roz bonds with the island's animals and cares for an orphaned baby goose.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9928,\"title\":\"Robots\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fnKCh67l2DDG9NxxIlk9IpsXQ99.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8p4gCdDT55PMY3UMDvo6ybzMrai.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rodney Copperbottom is a young robot inventor who dreams of making the world a better place, until the evil Ratchet takes over Bigweld Industries. Now, Rodney's dreams – and those of his friends – are in danger of becoming obsolete.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10054,\"title\":\"Spy Kids\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j3rUkHIAAoKr6jU30q3Db4fcIF9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aFHAnOI1sjHktgEX5lykeSiUZ1C.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Carmen and Juni think their parents are boring. Little do they know that in their day, Gregorio and Ingrid Cortez were the top secret agents from their respective countries. They gave up that life to raise their children. Now, the disappearances of several of their old colleagues forces the Cortez' return from retirement. What they didn't count on was Carmen and Juni joining the \\\"family business.\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12589,\"title\":\"Jimmy Neutron: Boy Genius\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pUwdquA6Bf3Gq8yT5iQL1Yq0jkl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9stTjA64EvFfNtrlO5XKvpBX351.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jimmy Neutron is a boy genius and way ahead of his friends, but when it comes to being cool, he's a little behind. All until one day when his parents, and parents all over Earth are kidnapped by aliens, it's up to him to lead all the children of the world to rescue their parents.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16577,\"title\":\"Astro Boy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6AK3uOHaIbl6EDaytHYe4FinZMu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t39jaNSYMVNecNPQSVVlW6I4opm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in the futuristic Metro City, Astro Boy (Atom) is a young robot with incredible powers created by a brilliant scientist in the image of the son he had lost. Unable to fulfill his creator's expectations, Astro embarks on a journey in search of acceptance, experiencing betrayal and a netherworld of robot gladiators, before returning to save Metro City and reconcile with the father who rejected him.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":438590,\"title\":\"A-X-L\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9kB56ZdMB6RgY5QtX9Bar45jCeI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2PCcEJ1lUJgir598yMGXkluJa6y.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The life of a teenage boy is forever altered by a chance encounter with cutting edge military technology.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":523777,\"title\":\"Next Gen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hUDDo5MPWM6rc6COQYhaoRNqvhE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iohOuTT3OAuvzkiNPFSL7fUWhD6.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A friendship with a top-secret robot turns a lonely girl's life into a thrilling adventure as they take on bullies, evil bots and a scheming madman.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13413,\"title\":\"BURN·E\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1wOReJq1vArLBSejND2Jbw0KeKh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gaLg3gpoJScDNfkDw4itX79Gi8x.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"What lengths will a robot undergo to do his job? BURN·E is a dedicated hard working robot who finds himself locked out of his ship. BURN·E quickly learns that completing a simple task can often be a very difficult endeavor.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":286987,\"title\":\"How to Build a Better Boy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ivo09vYN76w3epqAv9jS9BEXi5N.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vt5UhqjyWYbmJdZhrQsWpRCqCra.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After inadvertently inputting the qualities of the ideal boyfriend into a high-tech government computer, two social outcasts named Mae and Gabby must contend with Albert, a cybernetic sweetheart with only one directive: to treat Mae to the perfect highschool romance.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23056,\"title\":\"Pinocchio 3000\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qtTJzlzJf5FuY4qWjleSsLIgYjD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9viXmNTZczTzVQbQpImNr1hUsxO.jpg\",\"rating\":4.4,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the story of a little robot known as Pinocchio 3000 whose greatest wish is to become a real boy. The year is 3000. Geppetto, with the help of his faithful assistant, Spencer the cyber penguin, and by the holographic fairy Cyberina, creates Pinocchio, a prototype superrobot equipped for emotions. But before he can be given a heart and become a real boy, Cyberina insists that Pinocchio learn the difference between right and wrong.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2048,\"title\":\"I, Robot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/efwv6F2lGaghjPpBRSINHtoEiZB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jpFcZH2eyh6gcoxCa637TrGe4bT.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 2035, where robots are commonplace and abide by the three laws of robotics, a technophobic cop investigates an apparent suicide. Suspecting that a robot may be responsible for the death, his investigation leads him to believe that humanity may be in danger.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"yku2CXuKKiU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"OXrcDonY-B8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3RMqsRe-BxM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}